    <string name="settings_intro_title">Welcome to Clock Seconds</string>
    <string name="settings_intro_msg">Thanks for installing Clock Seconds!\n\n1. Activate: in LSPosed, enable this module and check “SystemUI”, then restart SystemUI.\n2. Show/hide seconds: tap the status-bar time (top left) to toggle. If it conflicts with pulling down the shade, switch to double-tap in “Toggle seconds gesture”.\n3. Hour color: tint the hour tens digit any color; off restores the system default.\n4. Floating time: long-press the status-bar time to show network time.\n5. Changes are immediate; if not, restart SystemUI or the device.</string>
